---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="bg-[#f9f9f9]">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="">Power Omnichannel Growth with Loyalty, Referrals, and Gift Cards</h2>
      <p class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-4">Key Features of 99minds - The Best Alternative to Yopto</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-14 mt-10">
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Shopify gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/GC.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Gift Cards</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Launch and manage physical and eGift cards with omnichannel redemption and scheduled delivery.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
          
        
      </div>
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/LP.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Loyalty Programs</p>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Offer an omni-channel loyalty program that boosts customer lifetime value and marketing performance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify store credit" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/CG.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Coupons & Promotions</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Generate millions of unique, dynamic, and SKU-based coupons with bulk creation and advanced rules.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify referral program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/SC.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Store Credit</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Automate refunds and reward customers with store credit usable both online and in-store.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/CG.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Integrations</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Native support for Shopify, Bigcommerce, Square POS, Vend, Heartland, and others, plus API and Zapier access.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Shopify pos" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/POS.webp">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Automated Workflows</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Create triggers and automate rewards based on customer actions to increase engagement.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-10">
          <a href="/Get-Started" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Get Started for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
